    "pitch2-pace2": {
      "A job for me on the board? Wonderful. Bring it all once you have it. I'll try not to forget!": "a30db6205fd2dcec.mp3",
      "Any news about that grey letter? Vetrinka will know what to do.": "471bcd748d7f3d56.mp3",
      "Finish any job from the board. Its reward comes to you at once.": "45a9fcd27326599a.mp3",
      "Good. Follow the path east until you feel the wind.": "798d0364d4d2ff14.mp3",
      "I have a note for Tobolko, down by the meadow. Can you take it to him?": "633e57fc7a54ad56.mp3",
      "Just what the post needed! Thank you, thank you.": "acf4f0e8bd13e731.mp3",
      "Mehurka is waiting for her bell. The shrine is just east of here.": "fee83cc58499af5a.mp3",
      "Mehurka says a rest at the shrine works wonders. Give it a try.": "22322789b33280c9.mp3",
      "No hurry. The letters can wait.": "7260111ce26a3945.mp3",
      "Nobody carries the mail alone out here. Pick a creature to travel with you, then come back for your first delivery.": "b87eb7cfe751c681.mp3",
      "Oh! Someone new at the post! Good to have you here. I'm Bavko, the postmaster of the Sky Post.": "d382b2b99d6cae90.mp3",
      "Thank you! Mehurka keeps the shrine, just east of here. Careful, the bell rings at every step.": "712d8567562e7b5e.mp3",
      "Thank you. Hurry, and watch out for the strong wind.": "20388c333476299e.mp3",
      "That letter found you before you found it. Whatever is out there, the Sky Post is with you.": "0c6bee0d40d602f6.mp3",
      "The letter, back again? Let me look at it once more.": "24ae4cb2349e9a10.mp3",
      "The shrine's old bell cracked in the last big gust. I have a new one. Will you take it to Mehurka?": "cda81dc41b8fa627.mp3",
      "The wind is gentle today. Good weather for letters.": "152670464b6ba727.mp3",
      "This came on the wind this morning. A grey envelope, all wet, and no sender.": "4fa781deafee45fd.mp3",
      "This is the job board, where odd jobs pile up. Do any you like! Finish one and a new one appears.": "a61f4c8c1b52409a.mp3",
      "Tobolko is waiting for that note. He's by the meadow.": "c157d62ab9c07cdb.mp3",
      "Tobolko was asking for you. He's by the meadow, west of here.": "d83841725d9cd743.mp3",
      "Vetrinka at the east lookout asked for this wind gauge. It shows how strong the wind is. Will you take it?": "7b1620f1db5b1d5a.mp3",
      "Vetrinka is at the east lookout. She knows the winds better than anyone.": "225e8d1ae3b2a8d5.mp3",
      "Vetrinka knows all about the weather. Maybe she can work this out too. Will you take it to her?": "1ed2e4ce57f184fd.mp3",
      "Wait. It's addressed to... you. \"To the new courier.\"": "9770e48ca4b49487.mp3",
      "Wonderful! Here's the note. Tobolko is by the meadow, west of here.": "64470e003b3412fe.mp3"
    },
    "pitch3-pace1": {
      "A Berry Bun! It smells wonderful. Now go and see Bavko. His job board is by the post office door.": "718b70748045d706.mp3",
      "A new teammate! Look how happy it is. That's what treats are for.": "48b5d9c28b29ed93.mp3",
      "A note from Bavko? For me? Thank you!": "a38c6656d6dd6378.mp3",
      "Any luck yet? Offer a treat in battle. Tired creatures say yes more often.": "5737e000af626263.mp3",
      "Great! The tall grass is right here. Come back when you're done.": "0c4c19aa866d3f10.mp3",
      "Listen! The meadow has calmed down. Great work!": "ae772663d9200bf7.mp3",
      "Now for my favourite part. Offer a treat to a wild creature in battle. If it likes you, it joins your team!": "edb11c3eebfa6c65.mp3",
      "Of course, of course. The grass will wait. It always does.": "b75e04f57a8ecd88.mp3",
      "Oh dear, is that job on the board for me? No rush. Bring it all when you have it.": "979cdb867b0d62df.mp3",
      "Oh, for me? How lovely, how lovely! Thank you!": "807f466511767844.mp3",
      "Oh, the meadow creatures are so jumpy today! Could you calm them down? Win 2 battles in the tall grass.": "a0af3794814f3294.mp3",
      "Out of treats? Oh dear, oh dear! Here, take three plain ones. Everyone deserves another try.": "28c99dd91fa7e769.mp3",
      "The cloudberry bushes are by the meadow, and the pot is right here next to me.": "26edd2b418c76363.mp3",
      "Three cloudberries, then a Berry Bun in the pot. Easy and tasty!": "13c3dedbd583fd6a.mp3",
      "Treats you make yourself work even better! Pick 3 cloudberries, then cook a Berry Bun in my pot.": "edaabde86df4dcdc.mp3",
      "Treats, bags, and more treats. That's my job!": "e4647da13600b08f.mp3",
      "Two wins in the tall grass, and the meadow will settle down. I believe in you!": "4f26c91107bf09f3.mp3",
      "Vetrinka says there's something odd in the clouds. I've packed extra treats, just in case.": "584fa7f1e81c5249.mp3",
      "Wonderful! A tired creature says yes more often. And its favourite treat works best.": "42632f823fe8081e.mp3",
      "Your bag holds treats for wild creatures, and here are three more. Look inside any time.": "960e27527cf9893f.mp3"
    },
    "pitch4-pace1": {
      "A job from the board. Bring all of it. No hurry.": "5ce0685256ede0f8.mp3",
      "A new bell. Clear voice. Thank you.": "6bc9fea6201f924f.mp3",
      "Bubbles rise. Rest comes. The shrine is calm.": "5d1fa4ddef91963d.mp3",
      "For me. Kind. Thank you.": "36a0052561e115c7.mp3",
      "Step onto the shrine to rest. Breathe. Watch the bubbles.": "da9477617792d52f.mp3",
      "Step onto the shrine to rest. Try it now. Bubbles help.": "d2840777550c8076.mp3",
      "The bubbles shiver today. Something far away. Stay close to the shrine.": "86e2eb01b9adf095.mp3",
      "This shrine heals. If your team faints, you wake up here. Safe.": "355ff5ac60844626.mp3"
    },
    "pitch4-pace3": {
      "\"The clouds over the far islands are going quiet. Something out there is hungry.\"": "83c62a4b8c08c315.mp3",
      "A grey letter, brought by the wind? Let me read it...": "35b8969482b9a0f6.mp3",
      "A job from the board for me? Bring it all at once. The wind won't wait, but I will.": "5bc95497b02866c7.mp3",
      "Bavko must see that letter. Hurry back to the post.": "6e830def9a2e3ba2.mp3",
      "Go to the lookout, just east of me. Look out over the sea of clouds. Quickly!": "c8fcf331ee487b34.mp3",
      "Hm. The wind turns east again. I don't like it.": "5c373f7263f15372.mp3",
      "I watch the far clouds every day now. If that thing comes back, we'll see it in time.": "ba4910d2bb110c78.mp3",
      "My wind gauge! Finally. Bavko never forgets... well, sometimes he forgets.": "2825e4233b227d81.mp3",
      "Right on time, before the wind turns. Thank you!": "4e087051d9bb8ff7.mp3",
      "See how it spins? The wind is wrong today. Win a battle in the windy grass to the south-west, then come back to me.": "562605b72354789a.mp3",
      "Strong out there, isn't it? And strange. The mail from the outer islands has stopped. Not one letter in days.": "7c22b59891d0dee4.mp3",
      "Take the letter back to Bavko. He needs to see this.": "4edb91c69c360d95.mp3",
      "Thank you for the help. Tell Bavko I'll keep watching the sky.": "524bfaad51ac9ed2.mp3",
      "That was no storm. Storms don't eat.": "8f169e7c756a195b.mp3",
      "The lookout is just east of me. Go and look out over the clouds.": "46569c2ceb5752da.mp3",
      "The windy grass is in the south-west. Win one battle there, then come back. Too hard? Train in the meadow first.": "e1738854c4ee125b.mp3"
    }
